# Threaded sample suites that no other CI lane runs under ThreadSanitizer,
# run by tools/tsan-samples.sh.  One test per line: the suite's
# directory, then the binary its Makefile builds.  The rest of the line,
# if any, is passed to the binary.
#
# Left out: benches (retro_spsc_bench, retro_eventcount_bench), suites
# that need hardware or a session bus (live_drivers, mutter_displayconfig,
# vulkan_validation), the SDL3 suites (no SDL3 package on the runner),
# stretch_epoch_test / stretch_pipeline_test, which take the better part
# of an hour each under TSan, and faulthandler_test, whose recovery
# jumps out of a signal handler by design - TSan reports what runs after
# it as still inside the handler.
libretro-common/samples/formats/h264 rh264_lossless_test
